network traffic or devices to bypass security controls.","mapped_categories":["Detective","Preventative"]},{"technique_id":"T0879","technique_title":"Modify Network Segmentation","technique_description":"Adversaries may attempt to modify network segmentation rules to bypass firewall restrictions and move laterally.","mapped_categories":["Detective"]},{"technique_id":"T0877","technique_title":"Modify Controller Tasking","technique_description":"Adversaries may modify controller configurations including network access controls.","mapped_categories":["Detective"]}]}
